OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA bright start for most,
OL,6,Fhowever, cloud and winds increasing
OL,7,Fthrough the morning with outbreaks of
OL,8,Frain edging south. Periods of mainly
OL,9,Flight rain continuing this afternoon,
OL,10,Fthe rain occasionally heavy towards
OL,11,Fthe Peak District. Breezy conditions
OL,12,Feasing later. Warm.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FRain tending to ease this
OL,15,Fevening and overnight with some clear
OL,16,Fspells possible, mainly in the north.
OL,17,FGreatest risk of further patchy rain
OL,18,Fin the south.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
