OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FRisk of early rain in the far
OL,6,Fsouth, otherwise soon becoming
OL,7,Fextensively bright or sunny with light
OL,8,Fwinds. Just a small chance of a
OL,9,Flocalised shower during the afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMostly
OL,12,Ffine, bright to start Monday, becoming
OL,13,Fwarm. Occasional rain, stronger winds
OL,14,Fdeveloping later. Cooler by Tuesday,
OL,15,Fwith bright or sunny spells and
OL,16,Fisolated blustery showers. Similar on
OL,17,FWednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
